# wp-content/plugins/** e wp-includes/** PRECISAM subir no deploy.
# O HTML dos posts/paginas referencia os CSS dos plugins (Kadence, Accordion
# Blocks, Premium Blocks, Fluent Forms) e o block-library do WordPress.
